OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Frain at times in the northwest, heavy
OL,7,Fin places across Northern Ireland and
OL,8,Fsouthern Scotland, turning brighter
OL,9,Flater. Elsewhere, largely dry with
OL,10,Fsunny spells. Cooler in the north, but
OL,11,Fhot and humid across much of England
OL,12,Fand Wales.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FA band of thicker cloud will
OL,15,Fcontinue to sink south on Thursday,
OL,16,Fintroducing fresher conditions for
OL,17,Fall. However, outbreaks of rain,
OL,18,Flocally heavy at times, will affect
OL,19,Fnorthern Scotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
